          "text": "Description: On August 12, 1977, around 11 PM, a witness observed in the sky a thin, motionless, very bright elongated shape. This phenomenon disappeared at extremely high speed towards the southwest after a few seconds. No other testimony about this phenomenon was collected, for which we lack information.",
